      "content": "idk i just got home and i'm so tired and honestly i just want to sleep it off. it's probably just stress from the trip and the plane air being so dry. u think i could just take some ibuprofen and drink a big bottle of water and sleep it out for a few hours? i feel like if i go to the er now i'll just be sitting there for hours for nothing and i'm really just drained.",
